# A repository with nothing committed yet: the project is staged, HEAD does not
# resolve, and the human names a base on the command line all the same. There is
# nothing to take that base against, so it is dropped rather than carried on an
# output whose diff comes from the staged tree — and the drop is said out loud,
# because a ref that was named and quietly ignored is worse than one refused.
FEATURE=Cart
GIT=yes
EXTRA=main
